       fhir:ElementDefinition.comment [ fhir:value "If only a code is specified, then it needs to be a code for a specific product. If more information is required, then the use of the Medication resource is recommended.  For example, if you require form or lot number or if the medication is compounded or extemporaneously prepared, then you must reference the Medication resource." ] ;
